     * * Write a function to find the lateral surface area of a cone.
     *
     * > lateralsurfaceCone(5, 12)
     * 204.20352248333654
     * > lateralsurfaceCone(10, 15)
     * 566.3586699569488
     * > lateralsurfaceCone(19, 17)
